    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="e51d90a0-b361-52a3-99c4-0dfdf61337c5" activityNameId="68990681-9dfb-54ba-8fa3-0635a93a4f5a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Paper machine, at paper mill</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Paper machine, at paper mill
The dataset represents a big offset paper machine, used e.g. for newsprint production.;
UUID: 60eac485-1d01-36d4-bfac-55b6711aeb65
This module includes the production of the paper machine, its transport to the paper mill and the material amount for the foundation of the machine. Also included is the final disposal of the machine.
Location: Data about one newsprint paper machine, installed in Sweden. Data valable for whole Europe.
Technology: rough estimation based on few information about one single paper machine
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: Based on information from Voith Paper Heidenheim about the total weight and the amount of chromium steel, the other parts of the machine were estimated and verified with experts. The energy amount for the production is a rough estimation, based on information from Literature. The transport is estimated based on a production place in the southern part of Germany
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_60eac485-1d01-36d4-bfac-55b6711aeb65.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
